{
 "readings": {
  "E1": "calendar = D17's dates 2019-01-02 -> 2026-10-22, then the D18 sessions after it up to 2026-11-04",
  "E2": "stock bars used for indicators: every D18 bar up to 2019-01-02, after that only bars on calendar sessions (F-AA-D15)",
  "E3": "indicator tables are computed at the decision dates and at the live window's first date only; for a stock whose weekly candle has a bar after the query date the supertrend is recomputed on bars up to the query date (the live first date, a Monday)",
  "E4": "I5 sign BUY iff ST sits on the final lower band (|ST-FLB|<1e-9); NaN or neither band = not computable = excluded",
  "E5": "n and k of a decision are measured on the basket in force at its trade session (at the decision session for the last decision); k = |P(j) & basket| with P(j) the pass set stored at the review r(j), so at a non-review SELL decision only the basket intersection can change k",
  "E6": "the null draws one uniform per stock per decision (J x N), but only the review rows are used: the k_{r(j)}(b) smallest of u[r(j)] within basket b are kept (uniform k-subset), k_{r(j)}(b) = |P(j) & b|; never u[j] at a non-review decision",
  "E7": "R5 = per draw_id the best of the five indicators' draws of that id (the plan's 'shared permutation seed' read as 'same draw id')",
  "E8": "initial position: basket at T0 as drifted since its availableDate scaled to 1 at T0's close; stocks outside the T0 kept set are sold at T0's close into the sleeve at no cost; BUY = whole basket (sleeve exactly 0)",
  "E9": "basket weights normalised to sum 1 over the whole basket; kept stocks keep their normalised weights",
  "E10": "constant mix: stock share f = mean over decisions of sum of kept weights (BUY = 1), rebalanced at the next session of every decision (T0's included) and at every basket change; initial stock holding = drifted basket scaled by f",
  "E11": "full AA switch comparator = this engine with k = 0 on every SELL decision (T03's rule on this window)",
  "E12": "review flag (T05.md 5a) computed for every decision of the window by `_review_mask`: last decision of each (year, month) by the decision's own date, or first SELL decision of a SELL spell (j = 0 if SELL); it has effect only where the regime is SELL",
  "E13": "stateless review: r(j) = latest flagged decision <= j is precomputed (np.maximum.accumulate), not tracked with a running variable; for a SELL decision r(j) lies in the same SELL spell because the first SELL decision of every spell is flagged. For a BUY decision before any flag (only j = 0 in BUY) r(j) is read as j; BUY targets never use it",
  "E14": "the last decision of the window (2026-11-04) is a month-end and carries the flag, but it is not traded: audit.json reports n_reviews (flagged SELL decisions, last included, as 5a defines it) and n_reviews_traded (last excluded); the reportability count uses the 5a definition (last included) and the traded-only count is printed beside it",
  "E15": "the live window (R4) is its own Book: its own decision series, review flags, stored pass sets and u (J_live x N, same seed)",
  "E16": "selections.csv keeps T04's long format (one row per window, indicator and decision) plus review_j = r(j); decisions.csv keeps T04's columns plus review, and PLAN.md's trade_session (= trade_date) and basket (effective date of the basket in force at the trade session)"
 },
